<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-157.2-standalone-selling-price-allocation-and-deferred-revenue-measurement" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4633" name="W4633. Standalone Selling Price (SSP) Methodology &amp; Estimation Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New multi-element arrangement; annual SSP refresh; market-price shift
Frequency: Per new obligation + annual/bi-annual refresh
Volume: SSP for ~ installation service, design service, warranty, loyalty points, subscription, bundle components, retail-media placement
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Pricing (VS-01.2), Merchandising (VS-01), Services (VS-12/VS-66), Analytics (VS-28), Controller, External Auditor
Source: workflow W4633 — Standalone Selling Price (SSP) Methodology &amp; Estimation Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4633_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4633_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4633_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4633_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4633_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4633_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4633_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4633_Start3" name="New multi-element arrangement; annual SSP refresh; market-price shift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4633_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4633_Task4" name="Define the SSP hierarchy/methodology per obligation type: (a) observable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the SSP hierarchy/methodology per obligation type: (a) observable standalone price first (when the obligation is also sold separately — e.g., extended warranty, some installation); (b) market-adjusted assessment; (c) residual approach only when permitted; (d) expected-cost-plus-margin for obligations never sold separately (installation bundled only)
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Pricing / Services
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per methodology</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4633_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4633_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4633_Task5" name="Maintain the SSP register with per-obligation SSP, data source, refresh date…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the SSP register with per-obligation SSP, data source, refresh date, and estimation variables (e.g., installation labor rate, warranty expected cost + margin); refresh on the cadence and on material market shifts (commodity/labor — links VS-106/VS-102)
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Analytics
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4633_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4633_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4633_Task6" name="Submit the SSP methodology and any judgment-heavy estimates to the External…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Submit the SSP methodology and any judgment-heavy estimates to the External Auditor for review at year-end (and pre-launch of new arrangements); document conclusions and retain evidence
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Controller / External Auditor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual + per launch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4633_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4633_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4633_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4633_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4633_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-702 (ensure controlled execution — Standalone Selling Price, Allocation &amp; Deferred-Revenue Measurement (PA-157.2).) | - CTL-702: documented SSP hierarchy; SSP register versioned and Controller-approved; judgment estimates auditor-reviewed
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4633_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4633_Annotation8" targetRef="W4633_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4633_Flow10" sourceRef="W4633_Start3" targetRef="W4633_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4633_Flow11" sourceRef="W4633_Task4" targetRef="W4633_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4633_Flow12" sourceRef="W4633_Task5" targetRef="W4633_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4633_Flow13" sourceRef="W4633_Task6" targetRef="W4633_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4633_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4633_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4633">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4633_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4633_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
