    <bpmn:process id="W_W4637" name="W4637. Subscription &amp; Extended-Warranty Deferred-Revenue Amortization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Subscription/warranty sale (VS-47/VS-53); monthly amortization cycle
Frequency: Monthly amortization + per sale
Volume: Subscription contracts (VS-47); extended-warranty contracts (VS-53); growing base
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Subscription/Warranty ops (VS-47/VS-53), Controller, Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W4637 — Subscription &amp; Extended-Warranty Deferred-Revenue Amortization</bpmn:documentation>
