    <bpmn:process id="W_W4639" name="W4639. Significant-Financing-Component &amp; Advance/Prepayment Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Long-term project with deferred payment (VS-11/VS-46); large advance/prepayment (VS-15 W498); annual review
Frequency: Per significant contract + annual
Volume: Project/G2G deferred-payment contracts; vendor advance payments (W498); subscription prepayments
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Trade/Government ops (VS-11/VS-46), Treasury (VS-18), AP (VS-15), Controller
Source: workflow W4639 — Significant-Financing-Component &amp; Advance/Prepayment Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4639_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4639_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4639_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4639_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4639_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4639_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4639_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4639_Start3" name="Long-term project with deferred payment (VS-11/VS-46); large advance/prepayment (VS-15…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4639_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4639_Task4" name="For contracts where payment timing differs significantly from delivery (e.g…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For contracts where payment timing differs significantly from delivery (e.g., project retainage over 12+ months, large customer deposits, long prepayment cycles), assess whether a significant financing component exists (&gt;12 months and material)
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Treasury
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4639_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4639_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4639_Task5" name="Where a significant financing component exists, adjust the transaction price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Where a significant financing component exists, adjust the transaction price for the time value of money (discount); separate interest revenue/expense; document the discount-rate rationale
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Treasury
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4639_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4639_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4639_Task6" name="For the practical expedients (no financing component if ≤12 months, or if…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For the practical expedients (no financing component if ≤12 months, or if consideration is variable and the financing element is indeterminate), document the basis; align with Treasury&#x27;s discount-rate policy (VS-18)
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Treasury
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4639_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4639_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4639_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4639_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4639_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-702 (ensure controlled execution — Standalone Selling Price, Allocation &amp; Deferred-Revenue Measurement (PA-157.2).) | - CTL-702: &gt;12-month/materiality screen applied; discount rate Treasury-aligned and documented; practical expedients basis recorded
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
