    <bpmn:process id="W_W4640" name="W4640. Contract Costs — Cost-to-Obtain &amp; Cost-to-Fulfill (Capitalization, Amortization &amp; Impairment)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Incremental contract-acquisition cost (sales commission); cost-to-fulfill (setup); annual impairment review
Frequency: Per contract + annual impairment
Volume: Sales commissions (VS-11/VS-107 trade &amp; key-account); fulfillment setup costs (subscription/marketplace onboarding)
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Sales (VS-11/VS-107), HR/Comp (VS-102), Controller, External Auditor
Source: workflow W4640 — Contract Costs — Cost-to-Obtain &amp; Cost-to-Fulfill (Capitalization, Amortization &amp; Impairment)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4640_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4640_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4640_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4640_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4640_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4640_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4640_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4640_Start3" name="Incremental contract-acquisition cost (sales commission); cost-to-fulfill (setup); annual…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4640_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4640_Task4" name="Identify incremental costs to obtain a contract (e.g., sales commissions tied…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify incremental costs to obtain a contract (e.g., sales commissions tied to winning a trade/key-account/G2G contract) and capitalize; expense other acquisition costs as incurred
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Sales / Comp
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4640_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4640_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4640_Task5" name="Identify costs to fulfill that generate/enhance resources used to satisfy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify costs to fulfill that generate/enhance resources used to satisfy obligations (e.g., subscription/marketplace onboarding setup) and capitalize; amortize both cost categories in proportion to revenue recognition (or straight-line if more faithful); apply the ≤12-month practical expedient for commissions where eligible
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per period</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4640_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4640_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4640_Task6" name="Assess impairment of capitalized contract costs each period (expected economic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Assess impairment of capitalized contract costs each period (expected economic benefits no longer expected); coordinate amortization with the sales-comp accrual (W228 trade commissions) and reconcile the asset GL
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Comp
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Quarterly + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4640_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4640_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4640_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4640_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4640_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-702 (ensure controlled execution — Standalone Selling Price, Allocation &amp; Deferred-Revenue Measurement (PA-157.2).) | - CTL-702: capitalization criteria applied; amortization aligned to revenue pattern; impairment reviewed quarterly; asset GL reconciled
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
